Rhythm Culture will be hosting a drum making workshop in early December for those of you that would like to make your very own professional African djembe. The one day workshop including equipment costs will be $200-$600 depending on chosen drum shell etc. This will be an end of year special event, so if you would like to treat yourself to a beautiful early xmas presnt so that you have some musical action over the holiday/festival break....now is the time! For more information and any questions please [contact us](/contact-us/).
